## Quick Reference Commands

**Health:**
```powershell
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --preflight
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --http-get https://mini.soulpulse.art/api/health
```

**Project workflow:**
```powershell
# 1. Claim branch
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --claim-branch --owner 468326902 --branch <key> --topic "<t>" --session <sid>

# 2. Read operational log (Level 1)
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --dsl "PROJECT.LOG.READ_OP project_id=<pid>"

# 3. Work... then mirror actions
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --dsl "LLM.MIRROR owner=\"468326902\" branch=\"<key>\" user_command=\"...\" agent_reply=\"...\""

# 4. Update log after step
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --dsl "PROJECT.LOG.UPDATE_OP project_id=<pid> step_title='...' step_result='...'"

# 5. Run inspectors before merge
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --dsl "INSPECTOR.RUN_ALL"

# 6. Release branch
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --dsl "SESSION.RELEASE branch=\"<key>\""
```

**Full CLI help:**
```powershell
python Soul/scripts/hyperloop_cli.py --help
```

**DSL grammar:** See `Soul/P36_TZ_Hyperloop_DSL_v1_1.md`

